<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Safari Gallery | Birds and Environment Safaris</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:#f5f7f4;
    color:#333;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.55),rgba(0,0,0,.55)),url("images/gallery-banner.jpg") center/cover;
    color:#fff;
    text-align:center;
    padding:90px 20px;
}

header h1{
    font-size:42px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

header p{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:18px;
}

.container{
    width:90%;
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:50px auto;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;
    color:#1b5e20;
    margin-bottom:35px;
    font-size:30px;
}

.gallery{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
}

.card img{
    width:100%;
    height:220px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.card h3{
    padding:15px;
    color:#1b5e20;
}

.card p{
    padding:0 15px 20px;
    line-height:1.6;
}

.cta{
    text-align:center;
    margin:60px 0;
}

.button{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#1b5e20;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:15px 35px;
    border-radius:6px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

footer{
    background:#222;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px 20px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Safari Gallery</h1>
<p>Explore Tanzania through unforgettable wildlife, breathtaking landscapes and authentic safari experiences.</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<h2 class="section-title">Our Gallery</h2>

<div class="gallery">

<div class="card">
<img src="images/lion.jpg" alt="Lion">
<h3>Big Five</h3>
<p>Witness Africa's legendary wildlife including lions, elephants, leopards, buffaloes and rhinos.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="images/birds.jpg" alt="Birds">
<h3>Bird Watching</h3>
<p>Discover hundreds of beautiful bird species across Tanzania's national parks and wetlands.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="images/landscape.jpg" alt="Landscape">
<h3>Scenic Landscapes</h3>
<p>From endless savannahs to mountains and rivers, every journey offers breathtaking views.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="images/safari-vehicle.jpg" alt="Safari Vehicle">
<h3>Safari Vehicles</h3>
<p>Travel comfortably in our professionally equipped safari vehicles with experienced guides.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="images/elephant.jpg" alt="Elephants">
<h3>Wild Encounters</h3>
<p>Enjoy unforgettable moments with elephants, giraffes, zebras, cheetahs and countless other animals.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="images/sunset.jpg" alt="Sunset">
<h3>African Sunsets</h3>
<p>End every adventure with spectacular golden sunsets across Tanzania's wilderness.</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="cta">
<h2>Ready for Your Safari?</h2>
<p style="margin:15px 0;">Book your unforgettable adventure today.</p>

<a class="button" href="booking.html">Book Now</a>

</div>

</div>

<footer>

<h3>Birds and Environment Safaris</h3>

