<p>✉ birdsandenvironment@outlook.com</p>

<p>Dar es Salaam, Tanzania</p>

<p style="margin-top:15px;">© 2026 Birds and Environment Safaris. All Rights Reserved.</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
